Malis looks at her clothes. Her T-shirt is made of cotton, and her jeans are made of denim. Grandma's scarf is made of Cambodian silk. Her winter jumper is wool. Her jacket has got a zip, two pockets and long sleeves. Her shirt has got five buttons.

